"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T09:43:21-08:00","id":1005741,"title":"","content":"i agree with narcissism. trump doesn't even want to be president. he just wants to hear people call him&quot; mr president&quot;<br /> this election would have been over had congress granted him a noble title or something?(douche/duke trump anyone<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />?)<br /> <br /> i don't see him as being any supernatural's pawn. most likely most of them were just as surprised and shocked as the rest of the planet when he was elected.<br /> <br /> that being said a few groups do have to gain from his presidency. nephandi/dancers/etc being only the most obvious.<br /> <br /> i can just imagine the tremere placing wards and warding circles against vampires in the foundations of this wall<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> &quot;vote trump because we all know which candidate melinda galbraith supports, the sabbat don't send us their best,they just send diablerists and murderers!!<br /> <br /> trump 2016 for a stronger ivory tower&quot;,<br /> <br /> <br /> Raphael de Corazon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1492-mark","name":"mark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T13:48:16-08:00","id":1005841,"title":"","content":"You folks got this whole Trump thing all wrong. Like 911, Trump's rise to power is a completely mundane, non-supernatural occurrence that none of the major powers had much or anything to do with.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd you know what? That just makes him even more terrifying if you ask me. The Carmilla, the Nephandi or the Technocracy would be such an easy scapegoat for the &quot;good guys&quot; of the WOD to blame, but nope, everything happened fair and square.<br /> <br /> \u200bPretty sure Trump is going to get a bunch of Ahi-I-Batin to rethink that whole Unity thing. The poor bastards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1675-weirdboyz","name":"Weirdboyz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1675_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T14:51:13-08:00","id":1005865,"title":"","content":"Entirely incorrect. That's not terrifying at all, and 'none of the major powers had much or anything to do with' is a gross oversiplification. <br /> <br /> <br /> Clinton beat Sanders because nobody, bar maybe the changing breeds, wanted a more socialist america. The party is backed by big business, and it's better that the democrats loose than it is to have Bernie in charge for the big business that'd normally back the democrats. <br /> <br /> Huge differences between rich and poor benefits vampires greatly. The rich give them stuff to do and the poor are a happy feeding ground where people can disapear and nobody would care. Vampires don't want everyone to be comfortably middle class. They don't benefit them. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile. N.W.O would have heavily favoured hillary. Syndicate too. Status quo, stability and political correctness. It's likely that several wyrmish fellows (nephandi, settites, WICs set out to toxify her and her causes from within and without. <br /> <br /> The camarilla enjoys racism. The cammy are mostly white. The sabbat are more diverse. &quot;Building a wall&quot; and enciting racial tensions helps to keep the sabbat out. No doubt the anarchs would have found parrallels with Sanders. The sabbat likely didn't pick a side. <br /> <br /> The same all likely happened with Brexit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","name":"Flower,Innocent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T17:02:48-08:00","id":1005906,"title":"","content":"If he's anything, nothing makes more sense than a Wayward Imbued.<br /> <br /> It explains his xenophobia, and his inexplicable inability to concealing contempt for certain individuals (they look &quot;wrong&quot;). It fits with him being an &quot;outsider&quot; candidate who doesn't fit onto any of the traditional conspiracies. It even explains why his business decisions often seem irrational from the outside; clearly, his actions are concealing some bizarre ulterior motive.<br /> <br /> Trump being elected marks the point when the Imbued officially become &quot;major players&quot;.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Now we just have to mash South Park in somehow. The real question is, what are the memberberries?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5553,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5553-mr-sluagh","user":"Mr. Sluagh","date":". 11-20-2016, 08:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5553-mr-sluagh","name":"Mr. Sluagh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T17:07:30-08:00","id":1005909,"title":"","content":"I'm surprised that nobody point this out yet:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://motherboard.vice.com/read/trumps-occult-online-supporters-believe-pepe-meme-magic-got-him-elected\" target=\"_blank\">http://motherboard.vice.com/read/tru...ot-him-elected</a><br /> <br /> The alt right's &quot;meme magic&quot; may very well have used chaos magic to invoke an ancient Egyptian frog god via building a mythology around Pepe the Frog to get Trump elected. Otherwords someone in the Virtual Adapts has truly fucked up and now one very mage's kill list...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12524,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","user":"Veindark","date":". 11-20-2016, 08:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","name":"Veindark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T18:08:50-08:00","id":1005924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Veindark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1005909#post1005909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised that nobody point this out yet:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://motherboard.vice.com/read/trumps-occult-online-supporters-believe-pepe-meme-magic-got-him-elected\" target=\"_blank\">http://motherboard.vice.com/read/tru...ot-him-elected</a><br /> <br /> The alt right's &quot;meme magic&quot; may very well have used chaos magic to invoke an ancient Egyptian frog god via building a mythology around Pepe the Frog to get Trump elected. Otherwords someone in the Virtual Adapts has truly fucked up and now one very mage's kill list...</div> </div> </div> </div>I saw that article, and I am the one who wrote that reddit message to you. Nice to see you again, Jannol<br /> <br /> Your reddit vampire fan pal:<br /> <br /> Satorui29<br /> <br /> And yeah, this whole election is what happens when you don't keep a close eye on the Virtual Adepts. And in this take on things, the liberals and leftists talking about Pepe only made the ritual more powerful and helped get Trump elected which is kind of scary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 11-20-2016, 09:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T18:28:29-08:00","id":1005928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr. Sluagh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1005906#post1005906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If he's anything, nothing makes more sense than a Wayward Imbued.<br /> <br /> It explains his xenophobia, and his inexplicable inability to concealing contempt for certain individuals (they look &quot;wrong&quot;). It fits with him being an &quot;outsider&quot; candidate who doesn't fit onto any of the traditional conspiracies. It even explains why his business decisions often seem irrational from the outside; clearly, his actions are concealing some bizarre ulterior motive.<br /> <br /> Trump being elected marks the point when the Imbued officially become &quot;major players&quot;.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Now we just have to mash South Park in somehow. The real question is, what are the memberberries?</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing about south park and the member berries is that they are meant to be a personification of how all the nostalgia in our culture might be part of a trend that primes people to accept reactionary and regressive ideas, which is a pretty interesting argument to be honest. The problem is that south park has a lot of reactionary fans who often fail to notice when south park is making fun of them as opposed to making fun of leftists and liberals.<br /> <br /> So in the WoD, the member berries are spirits of nostalgia for an older America that never actually existed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T22:28:29-08:00","id":1005999,"title":"","content":"Given the nature of the campaign, with many of his supporters backing him as a protest against &quot;political correctness&quot; (technically they were talking about the Overton Window, but close enough) shutting down debate, I can definitely get behind some sort of big <i>Mage</i> ploy - probably against the Syndicate, since he was constantly railing against globalization.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, it might be a sequel to the signature <i>Vampire</i> campaign . . . .shoot, I've forgotten the name. The one where the PCs were neonates from Gary, Indiana, sent to contact Lodin in Chicago? Lodin trashed the Rust Belt economy just to defeat his rival in Gary. But now, it turns out that the prince of Gary was just a pawn of some ancient vampire. One who wants to rebuild manufacturing in the US . . .<br /> <br /> For some nefarious reason, of course <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> This is the World of Darkness, after all","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","user":"One Vorlon","date":".  typo 11-21-2016, 02:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T03:41:59-08:00","id":1006099,"title":"","content":"Trump is a perfectly mundane human with a talent for telling people what they want to hear.<br /> <br /> Of course, the supernaturals have a hard time believing this and wildly accuse each other of conspirating against each other: Trump is the next masterpiece of the Red Question to disrupt the status quo! Trump has the support of the Camarilla to stamp out the Anarchs! Trump is the creation of the Technocracy to keep the people down! Trump is the creation of the Traditions to topple a &quot;corrupt&quot; technocracy-owned establishment! Trump is the creation of a cabal of tech-nephandi! etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3568-philhor","name":"PhilHor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T23:35:35-08:00","id":1006609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Veindark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1005909#post1005909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised that nobody point this out yet:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;http://motherboard.vice.com/read/trumps-occult-online-supporters-believe-pepe-meme-magic-got-him-elected&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">http://motherboard.vice.com/read/tru...ot-him-elected</a><br /> <br /> The alt right's &amp;quot;meme magic&amp;quot; may very well have used chaos magic to invoke an ancient Egyptian frog god via building a mythology around Pepe the Frog to get Trump elected. Otherwords someone in the Virtual Adapts has truly fucked up and now one very mage's kill list...</div> </div> </div> </div><i>The gates of Hell broke open in 1999. You really think it's a coincidence how that coincides with the rise of internet meme culture?<br /> <br /> Of course, most memes were just made by humans who jumped on the bandwagon, but some of the biggest ones? Pepe, the Troll Face, Slender Man, the &quot;Guy Fawkes&quot; mask that barely even looks human, let alone like Guy Fawkes, to name but a few? Those are all representations of demons. Don't share them unless you know whom you're giving power.<br /> <br /> Also, the name Plzktnxbai is not short for anything in English, and you'd better hope you've never pronounced it correctly. And just in case you needed another reason not to reenact &quot;2 Girls, 1 Cup&quot;... Yeah, you don't want to know what you'd summon.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5553-mr-sluagh","name":"Mr. Sluagh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T00:43:21-08:00","id":1006621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1005367#post1005367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">he seems like a nutter to you?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, he seems like the puppet of a nutter, the ultimate prank that went on for too long. I'm picturing some small gathering of Malkavians bragging about how they all did this grand prank in the 1300s, or how Fishmalky McStabshisownface nearly convinced people to elect a dog as mayor. And some neonate in the back is listening to all of this and decides the best way to earn some clan cred is trying his own prank on a grand scale. And he happened to have ghouled this orange-faced rich guy, and wouldn't it be funny if he got this freakish-looking guy to run for President? Not win obviously but just to run, get on TV, spout some nonsense, and laugh along with his clanmates as the rest of the ghoul's political party were torn between distancing themselves from the ghoul or supporting him.<br /> <br /> But then the joke goes too far. And nobody's laughing with the neonate anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T06:55:05-08:00","id":1006685,"title":"","content":"As I said on the same thread in Reddit, I don't mix politics into a game I play to escape reality once in a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T12:29:26-08:00","id":1006805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChristopherZacher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006685#post1006685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I said on the same thread in Reddit, I don't mix politics into a game I play to escape reality once in a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>Politics is the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","name":"Flower,Innocent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T13:08:14-08:00","id":1006822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flower,Innocent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006805#post1006805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Politics is the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Trying to be pithy just makes you look dense. If Trump v. Hillary politics was the actually game, very few of us would be playing it. Zach is clearly talking about real-world politics mixing poorly with a game meant to be about critters of the night.<br /> <br /> Politics between supernatural factions is all well and good; making Donald Trump a fomori so your pack can have an excuse to kill him is silly to the point of being gauche. I get it, the election was a shock, an upset, whatever, and now we are going to have a growling toupe for a president. Doesn't mean any of that has to ooze onto the gaming table.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T13:23:14-08:00","id":1006832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006822#post1006822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Trying to be pithy just makes you look dense. If Trump v. Hillary politics was the actually game, very few of us would be playing it. Zach is clearly talking about real-world politics mixing poorly with a game meant to be about critters of the night.<br /> <br /> Politics between supernatural factions is all well and good; making Donald Trump a fomori so your pack can have an excuse to kill him is silly to the point of being gauche. I get it, the election was a shock, an upset, whatever, and now we are going to have a growling toupe for a president. Doesn't mean any of that has to ooze onto the gaming table.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you made my point for me before I could respond, thank you. You summed up my opinion perfectly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T17:47:03-08:00","id":1006927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006822#post1006822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Politics between supernatural factions is all well and good; making Donald Trump a fomori so your pack can have an excuse to kill him is silly to the point of being gauche. I get it, the election was a shock, an upset, whatever, and now we are going to have a growling toupe for a president. Doesn't mean any of that has to ooze onto the gaming table.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I respect your opinion, I disagree. Real world events having a supernatural explanation has been a trope of the World of Darkness from back in 1st and 2nd edition, only really being frowned on in Revised and V20 (when it's addressed at all in the latter). Having more recent events follow that same trope is no more or less distasteful than not having them follow that trope, or ignoring that trope entirely. Different tables will have different tastes, and trying to imply that one of those tastes is inherently bad or should be entirely avoided accomplishes nothing, save to highlight your taste and present it as somehow innately superior to others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T18:25:57-08:00","id":1006947,"title":"","content":"You keep saying 'trope' but not all tropes are created equal. 'Beethoven was a space alien spy' is something WW/Onyx Path has been moving away from for years, because it is tired and not particularly inspiring as far as stories go. There's a reason vampires didn't do 9/11.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T19:21:19-08:00","id":1006962,"title":"","content":"vysha, Stranger, I think you both have a point regarding that trope, but the thing with Trump's election is that it is so weird and unexpected that in some ways it would be easier to suspend belief in a supernatural explanation than it would be to go with the real world explanation of supernatural beings not being involved at all.<br /> <br /> So stranger, I think you're right about this subject in regards to most recent historical events, but that Trump's election was the capstone of an election season that was very unusual in of itself due to a host of factors that weren't present (Wikileaks, Russian interference, a anti-establishment and anti-free trade uprising, white supremacists coming out in droves for Trump two equally and historically unpopular candidates, corrupt DNC fuckery against Sanders pissing off leftists who then didn't vote for Hilary, The DNC and Hilary helping trump get the nomination because they thought they could easily beat him, The media normalizing trump and giving him millions of dollars in free air time by focusing on him so much, the FBI's October surprise involving Anthony Wiener's sexting and the emails crossing streams, and all the other factors) in any previous election. Ultimately, Trump is the result of a perfect storm of insanity that makes it so that WoD fans are probably less likely to believe supernatural beings weren't involved in the WoD election, as opposed to the IRL reason simply because this is one of those events where truth will always be stranger than fiction no matter what that fiction is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T19:28:20-08:00","id":1006965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006962#post1006962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">h, the FBI's October surprise involving Anthony Wiener's sexting and the emails crossing streams, and all the other factors)</div> </div> </div> </div>See, this makes sense. The ghostbusters were behind the Repub win!<br /> <br /> <br /> Never cross the streams!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3695,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","user":"The Laughing Stranger","date":". 11-23-2016, 03:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T19:41:31-08:00","id":1006976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vysha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006621#post1006621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, he seems like the puppet of a nutter, the ultimate prank that went on for too long. I'm picturing some small gathering of Malkavians bragging about how they all did this grand prank in the 1300s, or how Fishmalky McStabshisownface nearly convinced people to elect a dog as mayor. And some neonate in the back is listening to all of this and decides the best way to earn some clan cred is trying his own prank on a grand scale. And he happened to have ghouled this orange-faced rich guy, and wouldn't it be funny if he got this freakish-looking guy to run for President? Not win obviously but just to run, get on TV, spout some nonsense, and laugh along with his clanmates as the rest of the ghoul's political party were torn between distancing themselves from the ghoul or supporting him.<br /> <br /> But then the joke goes too far. And nobody's laughing with the neonate anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What can he do then? shake his head sadly in despair at the wisdom of the average voter, or try summoning his ghoul so he can drain him dry...<br /> <br /> <br /> Trump looks more to me, like a Nosferatu Ghoul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T21:18:18-08:00","id":1007020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006965#post1006965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> See, this makes sense. The ghostbusters were behind the Repub win!<br /> <br /> <br /> You're never supposed cross the streams!</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I set myself up for that, you earned that quip. But what I meant is that the FBI reopening the case right before the election was because of Wiener going down for sexting again, they found the new emails on his laptop when they seized it because he got caught sexting a minor. basically the two scandals combined to take her down, among many other factors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T01:13:33-08:00","id":1007093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006947#post1006947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You keep saying 'trope' but not all tropes are created equal. 'Beethoven was a space alien spy' is something WW/Onyx Path has been moving away from for years, because it is tired and not particularly inspiring as far as stories go. There's a reason vampires didn't do 9/11.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's funny how, from time to time, WoD fans and writers will have this horrible realization that some specific WoD trope is silly and they'll get all embarassed and try to abolish that one trope as if that will stop people who turn into wolves and enter the spirit world through mirrors from being silly.<br /> <br /> Come on, &quot;Vlad Dracul was a vampire&quot; is one of the ur-examples of the trope in question. And it would just seem like a really weird coincidence in a modern occult setting for no historial figures to have been or interacted with supernatural creatures. What, is there some kind of Jim Crow-esque system to prevent famous people from mingling with vampires?<br /> <br /> All this trend is doing is moving the WoD closer to being nothing more than a total fantasy setting with no connection to the real world except technology and geography.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5553,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5553-mr-sluagh","user":"Mr. Sluagh","date":". 11-23-2016, 04:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5553-mr-sluagh","name":"Mr. Sluagh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T01:52:49-08:00","id":1007103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr. Sluagh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1007093#post1007093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's funny how, from time to time, WoD fans and writers will have this horrible realization that some specific WoD trope is silly and they'll get all embarassed and try to abolish that one trope as if that will stop people who turn into wolves and enter the spirit world through mirrors from being silly.<br /> <br /> Come on, &quot;Vlad Dracul was a vampire&quot; is one of the ur-examples of the trope in question.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. I bet if we let the 'Donald Trump is undead' story percolate for a few hundred years it might develop a bit more gravitas and layers of meaning.<br /> <br /> All I am saying is that 'hey this public figure I don't like is really a pawn of some supernatural beastie' seems more like Saturday Night Live and less like WoD. Folks are just focusing on Trump because of the election, but if Bernie Sanders or Hillary Clinton were backed by some sort of unnatural being, it would still be the creative equivalent of picking a celebrity and turning them into a vampire/werewolf/wizard/fairy-hybrid. That conceit, in-and-of-itself, isn't a crime, but don't try to tell me that Donald Trump secretly being a Nephandi is on par with Stoker.<br /> <br /> People in this thread mentioned using the fantasy as a way of dealing with the real-world outcome of the election, and to that I say: whatever floats your boat, yo. But I think WW/Onyx Path's decision to avoid the 'Historical/modern figure is a splat critter' speaks for itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T02:14:00-08:00","id":1007109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1007103#post1007103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026I think WW/Onyx Path's decision to avoid the 'Historical/modern figure is a splat critter' speaks for itself.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Except for Rasputin!<br /> He is all the critters! <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T06:56:20-08:00","id":1007216,"title":"","content":"no just a rabbit, how do I add my Wraith kickstarter badge if I could ask?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T08:50:53-08:00","id":1007276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1006947#post1006947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You keep saying 'trope' but not all tropes are created equal. 'Beethoven was a space alien spy' is something WW/Onyx Path has been moving away from for years, because it is tired and not particularly inspiring as far as stories go. There's a reason vampires didn't do 9/11.</div> </div> </div> </div>So let's start off with the obvious: there is a massive difference than a horrible terrorist attack that led to wars, paranoia, increased surveillance of civilians, extrajudicial renditions, and far worse... And an election. While Trump's winning the EC vote <i>could</i> certainly lead to worse, it <i>might</i> also lead to nothing much of note. An actual attack against the country is far and away different, and not really worth comparing.<br /> <br /> You say alternative history, IE the genre where a &quot;Beethoven was an alien&quot; would be categorized into, is tired and uninspired. The same could be said about, say, vampires in the modern age, which have done in every imaginable way at this point and nearly all &quot;new takes&quot; on the subject instantly bring to mind some other example where it was done the same way. However, there are far fewer examples of alternate history in fiction than vampires in the modern day, a far more specific example of a trope.<br /> <br /> Revised did try and move away from the WoD's alternate history bits, true. I not only don't dispute that, I'm also the one who brought it up. But does their moving away from that trope over a six year period (the length of Revised) invalidate the seven years prior? (I exempt V20 from this because V20 has kept a metaplot-agnostic stance and really never addresses the subject either way in any noteworthy manner.)<br /> <br /> So again, I get that you don't like it, and that's fine. But I disagree with that opinion, and apparently so do others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-23T14:04:29-08:00","id":1007420,"title":"","content":"Trump is a perfectly ordinary, if self-absorbed human being. My NWO Operative gave him a \u00b745 caliber lobotomy after Trump &quot;accidentally&quot; felt up their chest. They weren't inclined to be gentle under the circumstances. Mike Pence was also eliminated. The gender-fluid Technocrat is not going to like you. Good riddance in our game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1973,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","user":"Saint Michael","date":". 11-23-2016, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T11:08:50-08:00","id":1008207,"title":"","content":"Come on, everyone knows 9/11 was an Assamite conspiracy...<br /> <br /> LOL Even I can't say that with a straight face. I'm sorry, but I find it cute how emotionally involved you guys get in this sort of thing. It's only a game :-)<br /> <br /> <br /> Colleen","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T11:13:17-08:00","id":1008210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JulianMoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008207#post1008207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Come on, everyone knows 9/11 was an Assamite conspiracy...<br /> <br /> LOL Even I can't say that with a straight face.I'm sorry, but I find it cute how emotionally involved you guys get in this sort of thing. It's only a game :-)<br /> <br /> <br /> Colleen</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, my head canon on 9/11 in the WoD is that Bin Laden really was just an ordinary mortal terrorist who got lucky, but that he killed a lot of high level syndicate magi in 9/11 without even realizing it because they had a secret facility under the world trade center that was destroyed when the towers fell and crushed it.<br /> <br /> But the point I was making is that Trump's election is weird enough where a supernatural conspiracy makes more sense to a reader than him somehow not being involved with any of the WoD's supernatural groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T11:13:33-08:00","id":1008211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JulianMoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008207#post1008207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Come on, everyone knows 9/11 was an Assamite conspiracy...<br /> <br /> LOL Even I can't say that with a straight face. I'm sorry, but I find it cute how emotionally involved you guys get in this sort of thing. <b>It's only a game :-)</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Colleen</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/m1PKKdz0S34?t=4\" data-code=\"m1PKKdz0S34\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/m1PKKdz0S34/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T05:46:10-08:00","id":1008504,"title":"","content":"I find this thread rather ironic because a big part of Trump's appeal was that his fans believed he was <u><b>not</b></u> part of some big conspiracy, whereas Clinton had almost all the wealthy and the powerful on her side.<br /> <br /> If Trump was in the WoD he would probably serve as a cautionary tale to the various races that sometimes no amount of behind-the-scenes manipulation can affect events when history has already made up its almost completely random mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T07:29:10-08:00","id":1008525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the_1990</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008504#post1008504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find this thread rather ironic because a big part of Trump's appeal was that his fans believed he was <u><b>not</b></u> part of some big conspiracy, whereas Clinton had almost all the wealthy and the powerful on her side.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is suspicious in itself - how does one win presidency as such an outsider?? There must be a coterie of Methuselahs behind this!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T08:32:48-08:00","id":1008556,"title":"","content":"He's a Faustian Devil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T10:05:47-08:00","id":1008590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the_1990</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008504#post1008504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find this thread rather ironic because a big part of Trump's appeal was that his fans believed he was <u><b>not</b></u> part of some big conspiracy,</div> </div> </div> </div>Hence why he must be part of one! After all, people believe there is <b><i>not </i></b>a global society of vampires, werewolves do <b><i>not </i></b>exist, and magic is <b><i>not </i></b>real! The more the masses do <i><b>not </b></i>believe in something, the more likely it is that something exists!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T10:45:26-08:00","id":1008604,"title":"","content":"i do like the notion that in a world where the illuminati actually exists an event like this catches the technocracy completely off guard. the Ivory tower weeps, the Syndicate laughs, until they realize this is actually happening, the camarilla looks around at each other wondering who threw the wild card in the great game, the Sabat begins stockpiling whatever types of explosives you use to blow up big walls. dogs and cats living together, mass hysteria","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>there are no bad ideas, just ideas that have not been refined enough","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1608-iamthesweeper","name":"IAmTheSweeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T11:28:48-08:00","id":1008623,"title":"","content":"which unseelie house , Balor or Ailil, would be more li kely to have used him as its instrument...<br /> <br /> Balor might want to have him as president just so they could laugh evilly... and watch everyone fearing his ultra conservative actions... Ailil likes enigmatic, and might have some incomprehensible conspiracy to protect the dreaming by electing him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T12:34:35-08:00","id":1008646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008623#post1008623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">which unseelie house , Balor or Ailil, would be more li kely to have used him as its instrument...<br /> <br /> Balor might want to have him as president just so they could laugh evilly... and watch everyone fearing his ultra conservative actions... Ailil likes enigmatic, and might have some incomprehensible conspiracy to protect the dreaming by electing him.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">I think some of his &quot;campaign promises&quot; sound like the rantings of a charismatic Balor warlord. I'm sticking with House Balor-ennobled pooka.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T12:41:51-08:00","id":1008648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1004232#post1004232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This thread will be locked within eight replies, calling it now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given what Lex said, I would just like to thank you all for keeping this thread civil for 70 replies, shows that whether we be leftist or rightist, we are all united by our love of WoD..<br /> <br /> <br /> Now to get back on topic, the idea of Trump being a rando that nobody was expecting is kind of funny and I imagine that the resulting dash by all the factions to gain control of him would be best set to Yackety Sax as the cam, Sabbat, Pentax, Silver Fangs (because of Russian influence), Virtual Adepts, Technocrats and everyone else all make idiots out of themselves trying to flatter Trump into doing what they want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T13:42:15-08:00","id":1008667,"title":"","content":"Or everyone thinks that Trump is the puppet of their enemies and they act on it, plunging the World of Darkness into an underground war.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T13:48:59-08:00","id":1008670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008648#post1008648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given what Lex said, I would just like to thank you all for keeping this thread civil for 70 replies, shows that whether we be leftist or rightist, we are all united by our love of WoD..<br /> <br /> <br /> Now to get back on topic, the idea of Trump being a rando that nobody was expecting is kind of funny and I imagine that the resulting dash by all the factions to gain control of him would be best set to Yackety Sax as the cam, Sabbat, Pentax, Silver Fangs (because of Russian influence), Virtual Adepts, Technocrats and everyone else all make idiots out of themselves trying to flatter Trump into doing what they want.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Silver Fangs (because of Russian influence) </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Silver Fangs... Russian... </div> </div> </div>Any influence they had in Russia was utterly crushed a century ago, and given that former officials of the USSR were the ones to make the CIS, it's not going to come back. Additionally, the tribe has many branches around the world, and every tribe except the Fianna exists in Russia. At this point, there can't be any meaningful connection between the Silver Fangs and Russia, Ural Mountains caern or otherwise, particularly if we're talking about political movers and shakers in Russia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T11:31:12-08:00","id":1008983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1008648#post1008648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and everyone else all make idiots out of themselves trying to flatter Trump into doing what they want.</div> </div> </div> </div>PFFT!!! More likely, a mini-supernatural war is waged, only inside the mind of Trump as every supernatural with a means of mind-control tries using it on Trump. A Ventrue dominates him to get him to sign off on something, a minute later a Lasombra uses Dominate preventing him from signing off on that same thing, then the Malkavian comes in and makes him forget all about the thing. And then the Technocrats get in the mix. And a few Glass Walkers and BSDs. And that's just what happens on Tuesday.<br /> <br /> By being nobody's tool, he becomes everyone's tool. And because they're all pushing him in opposing directions, they end up cancelling each other out and he just does what he was going to do anyway, probably none the wiser of this shadow battle for control over his will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T14:13:16-08:00","id":1009047,"title":"","content":"He does what he wants thanks to the Technocratic Union putting a mind shield on him!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T16:26:40-08:00","id":1009079,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">I wonder if this means <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Jayne_Jonestown\" target=\"_blank\">Jayne Jonestown</a> is going to decapitate him...</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T04:04:22-08:00","id":1009269,"title":"","content":"If you believe that the Russians conspired in making Trump then one could argue this scenario.<br /> <br /> You could argue that since the fall of the USSR the Akritai have been attempting to get one of their own in power amongst the Russian Government. They had more success than they could have ever imagined when an experienced member of their St. Petersburg Chapter named Vladimir Putin became President of the country. With Putin in power he used his influence to make it far easier for his fellow Akritai to operate throughout the country without interference from the Russian state.<br /> <br /> Realizing how much the Crusade against the Kindred could be helped by having powerful friends the Akritai reached out to other hunters across the world, including the FBI Special Affairs Division. The SAD agreed that having a president on their side would make life a lot easier so they approached FBI Director James Comey and DIA Director Mike Flynn and informed them of what they knew of the Masquerade. It was agreed that Flynn would seek out a viable candidate who he would serve as an advisor to, while Comey would wait until the opportune moment to discredit said candidate's opponent. Meanwhile, the Akritai who had infiltrated Russian intelligence would work to provide damaging material.<br /> <br /> Flynn soon found a man who he felt could serve their purpose; the successful businessman Donald J. Trump. Unwilling to reveal the whole truth to Trump, Flynn decided he would simply influence him into making decisions that would aid hunters throughout the US.<br /> <br /> The plan worked, the SAD mobilized all kinds of hunters across the United States to support Trump, and eventually he emerged as victor, it remains to be seen if President Trump will deliver on the expectations of the Hunters who helped him become President.<br /> <br /> Or that's at least one way you could interpret it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T13:20:59-08:00","id":1009916,"title":"","content":"If I'm playing Trump in the CWoD, he's an Autumn Person, almost a Dauntain, a living force of Banality. I see him as a cross between a Lost and a Typhoid, but he lacks the focus to use, or even be aware of Agendas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T14:15:24-08:00","id":1009935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the_1990</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1009269#post1009269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you believe that the Russians conspired in making Trump then one could argue this scenario.<br /> <br /> You could argue that since the fall of the USSR the Akritai have been attempting to get one of their own in power amongst the Russian Government. They had more success than they could have ever imagined when an experienced member of their St. Petersburg Chapter named Vladimir Putin became President of the country. With Putin in power he used his influence to make it far easier for his fellow Akritai to operate throughout the country without interference from the Russian state.<br /> <br /> Realizing how much the Crusade against the Kindred could be helped by having powerful friends the Akritai reached out to other hunters across the world, including the FBI Special Affairs Division. The SAD agreed that having a president on their side would make life a lot easier so they approached FBI Director James Comey and DIA Director Mike Flynn and informed them of what they knew of the Masquerade. It was agreed that Flynn would seek out a viable candidate who he would serve as an advisor to, while Comey would wait until the opportune moment to discredit said candidate's opponent. Meanwhile, the Akritai who had infiltrated Russian intelligence would work to provide damaging material.<br /> <br /> Flynn soon found a man who he felt could serve their purpose; the successful businessman Donald J. Trump. Unwilling to reveal the whole truth to Trump, Flynn decided he would simply influence him into making decisions that would aid hunters throughout the US.<br /> <br /> The plan worked, the SAD mobilized all kinds of hunters across the United States to support Trump, and eventually he emerged as victor, it remains to be seen if President Trump will deliver on the expectations of the Hunters who helped him become President.<br /> <br /> Or that's at least one way you could interpret it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The problem with this plan, as I see it, is that Trum