 get laws passed solely to benefit them. The Technocracy, even in their most sympathetic write-ups, use the government as a weapon and a tool to fight off their enemies first and as a means to help humanity second (if at all). It's often implied that elections are a smoke screen meant to make the masses feel as if they have some degree of control over the world, when in truth it doesn't matter who wins because the Powers That Be already own both candidates.<br /> <br /> What exactly is so insulting about implying a fictitious version of Trump would follow those same trends, just because he (like all politicians before him) claims that he's going to fix all the problems and make everything better?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T10:36:19-08:00","id":1012661,"title":"","content":"I always thought of Donald Trump as a neonate Giovanni and Hillary Clinton being the Ventrue's Ventrue....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T10:43:48-08:00","id":1012665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container