ate":"2016-12-07T11:14:31-08:00","id":1013854,"title":"","content":"does it seem too broken a version of &quot;taking the forgotten&quot; that lets you steal metaphorical things and have them forgotten?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T11:39:14-08:00","id":1013869,"title":"","content":"Some actual rules crunch which can be fun to critique. This is a lot more interesting to me. I changed to format a bit to something I'm more used to seeing. Corrected some spelling stuffs and his name too, so this isn't a direct quote as such:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1013389#post1013389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Donald Trump<br /> Yeren, Rank 2<br /> <br /> ATTRIBUTES<br /> Str 2/Dex 3/Sta 3<br /> Cha 3/Man 5/App 1<br /> Per 3/Int 4/Wits 4<br /> <br /> Abilites:<br /> TALENTS<br /> Alertness 2, Athletics 3, Brawl 2, Empathy 1, Expression 4 (Hes pretty good at impressing people with his speaches, even if they make no sense), Leadership 1, Intimidation 3, Primal urge 0 (still getting a hang of being part beast), Streetwise 2 (He knows his way around a backroom deal), Subterfuge 5 (No one BS's like him!)<br /> <br /> SKILLS<br /> Animal Ken 1, Drive 1, Etiquette 2, Firearms 3, Larceny 2 (Not the best, but no stranger to stealing), Melee 1 (Might have practice how to use a sword or pole, once or twice), Performance 2 (Might be neccessary for his speaches)<br /> <br /> KNOWLEDGES<br /> Academics 2, Computer 2, Enigmas 2, Investigation 4 (is very good at digging up dirt), Law 3, Occult 3 (He had to study for a bit as part of going through the change), Rituals 3 (hes working on being able to pass on &quot;the shadow of the ape&quot;, Science 2 (He didnt fall asleep in college), Technology 1<br /> <br /> Backgrounds<br /> Allies : ROFL<br /> Contacts 4 (Some people in Pentex and his campaign management.)<br /> Mentor 4. (Either another Yeren, or a ranking member of pentex's board of directors, or both.)<br /> Resources 5 (Should II tap Mage and give him a a higher resources, marking his multi billionaire status?)<br /> Fetish (thinking about some kind of mirror to let him look on the only person in the universe who loves him)<br /> <br /> Traits<br /> Rage 6<br /> Gnosis 4<br /> Willpower 5<br /> <br /> Gifts<br /> Level 1: Acid Talons ,Glass Canyon Predator, bestowing the Predators Shadow, MiddleMan, shit runs down hill<br /> Level 2: Between the Cracks, Distractions , Glib tongue, Monkey Leap, Taking the Forgotten. (OOC: thinking including a note hes refined this gift to apply to metaphorical things, thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>Now for this character, I would say a bunch of the stats are off. His physicals should certainly be tertiary. Either 2/2/2 or maybe 2/2/3 at best. Dex 3 doesn't seem right to me. App 1 is likewise silly. I'd give him average. Int is definitely not 4. I'd wager Wits shouldn't be either. Maybe 3 for both of them, giving him a Mental spread of 2/3/3 (secondary). Socials I can see as 3/5/2 or 3/4/2.<br /> <br /> The abilities also strike me as being off.<br /> Talents: I'm fine with expression and Intimidation being what they are, but Athletics 3 seems kind of high. Empathy is probably 0.<br /> Skills: Animal Ken and Melee seem unnecessary for the character concept. Firearms of 3 could also be a point or 2 lower (I don't actually know for him)<br /> Knowledges: Computer 1 at best. Investigation is way too high. He hires people for that. Law 3 seems like a huge stretch. Maybe just 1 dot there. Occult really seems out of place. Science kind of has to be 0.<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: I don't think he's got a Mentor. Maybe a spiritual patron (take the Totem background?). And Resources 5 seems perfectly fine. You can't actually prove he's a multi-billionaire so 5 should cover it well enough for any in game needs.<br /> <br /> Traits: Rage and Will seem fine. I'd lower his Gnosis some.<br /> <br /> Gifts: No input here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T12:36:30-08:00","id":1013906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1013869#post1013869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some actual rules crunch which can be fun to critique. This is a lot more interesting to me. I changed to format a bit to something I'm more used to seeing. Corrected some spelling stuffs and his name too, so this isn't a direct quote as such:<br /> <br /> Now for this character, I would say a bunch of the stats are off. His physicals should certainly be tertiary. Either 2/2/2 or maybe 2/2/3 at best. Dex 3 doesn't seem right to me. App 1 is likewise silly. I'd give him average. Int is definitely not 4. I'd wager Wits shouldn't be either. Maybe 3 for both of them, giving him a Mental spread of 2/3/3 (secondary). Socials I can see as 3/5/2 or 3/4/2.<br /> <br /> The abilities also strike me as being off.<br /> Talents: I'm fine with expression and Intimidation being what they are, but Athletics 3 seems kind of high. Empathy is probably 0.<br /> Skills: Animal Ken and Melee seem unnecessary for the character concept. Firearms of 3 could also be a point or 2 lower (I don't actually know for him)<br /> Knowledges: Computer 1 at best. Investigation is way too high. He hires people for that. Law 3 seems like a huge stretch. Maybe just 1 dot there. Occult really seems out of place. Science kind of has to be 0.<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: I don't think he's got a Mentor. Maybe a spiritual patron (take the Totem background?). And Resources 5 seems perfectly fine. You can't actually prove he's a multi-billionaire so 5 should cover it well enough for any in game needs.<br /> <br /> Traits: Rage and Will seem fine. I'd lower his Gnosis some.<br /> <br /> Gifts: No input here.</div> </div> </div> </div>The case for a high empathy score could be made maybe because he can empathize, he may not care, but he can put himself in certain people's shoes and thus figure out what he needs to say to get them to support him?<br /> <br /> BTW FML I can't believe I am discussing this lol.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T13:02:27-08:00","id":1013927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChristopherZacher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1013906#post1013906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The case for a high empathy score could be made maybe because he can empathize, he may not care, but he can put himself in certain people's shoes and thus figure out what he needs to say to get them to support him?<br /> <br /> BTW FML I can't believe I am discussing this lol.</div> </div> </div> </div>haha. The forums are weird sometimes.<br /> <br /> I think that falls more under Subterfuge honestly (maybe Leadership). Having high scores in Empathy implies (to me) that the person can and does empathize. I can certainly see your point though.<br /> <br /> Approaching this topic from a crunch point of view is something much more enjoyable/interesting. It puts a certain distance between reality and game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T13:08:00-08:00","id":1013933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a hre