br /> Traits: Rage and Will seem fine. I'd lower his Gnosis some.<br /> <br /> Gifts: No input here.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> you dont think hed have taken the trouble to improve his gnosis at all?<br /> <br /> oh on the Gurahl thing earlier, just curious? how would Gurahl have reacted if they heard o ne of their own say &quot;Global warming is a chinese hoax, to render american manufacturing noncompetive&quot;?<br /> <br /> What diff is the subterfuge roll to say that or his supporters he won by a &quot;landslide&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 03-14-2017, 02:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T16:05:48-08:00","id":1014496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1014486#post1014486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">you dont think hed have taken the trouble to improve his gnosis at all?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. It's too...quiet. Gnosis isn't flashy. And so I don't see it being a priority.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> oh on the Gurahly thing earlier, just curious? how would Gurahl have reacted if they heard o ne of their own say &quot;Global warming is a chinese hoax, to render american manufacturing noncompetive&quot;? </div> </div> </div> maybe have an Elder show up and paw him upside the head. Repeatedly. But really, there is zero chance he could be Gurahl.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What diff is the subterfuge roll to say that or his supporters he won by a &quot;landslide&quot; </div> </div> </div>Not hard. It's easy to say whatever you want. It's on the listeners in this case to choose to believe it.<br /> Maybe have a required successes it you want to get into that. <br /> <br /> This gets too close to reality again for my taste though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T19:13:48-08:00","id":1014573,"title":"","content":"Sorry thought it was a good example of how such rolls work and I know you can say whatever you want but convincing people its true...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T19:40:00-08:00","id":1014580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1014573#post1014573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry thought it was a good example of how such rolls work and I know you can say whatever you want but convincing people its true...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, but I think on that one the people are already convinced it's true, and they're just taking his saying so as validation. He isn't actually convincing anyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T20:25:53-08:00","id":1014590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1014496#post1014496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah. It's too...quiet. Gnosis isn't flashy. And so I don't see it being a priority.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Fair enough at what point do you see a Yeren strengthening their gnosis?<br /> <br /> Each and everyonees pointless short sighted greed writ large, after all.<br /> <br /> <br /> after getting a scare from a danger, they were just barely able to step sideways to get away from?<br /> <br /> When they have a gift that depends on it, a nd want to be able to use it more often?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 12-08-2016, 11:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-08T22:13:29-08:00","id":1014617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1014590#post1014590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Fair enough at what point do you see a Yeren strengthening their gnosis?<br /> <br /> Each and everyonees pointless short sighted greed writ large, after all.<br /> <br /> <br /> after getting a scare from a danger, they were just barely able to step sideways to get away from?<br /> <br /> When they have a gift that depends on it, a nd want to be able to use it more often?</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are all good reasons. I just think the character in this case (Trump) wouldn't think it important. He would spend time focusing on flashier more immediate payoffs. <br /> <br /> Increasing one's Gnosis would involve long hours of meditation and/or Umbral adventures. Those just aren't things I see him doing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T16:28:19-08:00","id":1056367,"title":"","content":"He's just a guy.<br /> <br /> He comes through on some of his promises, doesn't come through on the rest... he does, in short, what just about every other politician in the history of ever has done.<br /> <br /> In my World of Darkness, he's the face of the slow, indifferently cruel tedium of the American political elite - he represents the slow and inexorable march back towards the mush, the mire, the blood-choked pit from which humanity crawled out of, all those centuries ago; a march that's happening simply because humanity so seldom manages to muster the will and the courage it needs to save itself.<br /> <br /> Of course, had Hillary won, the exact same thing would have happened; maybe slower, maybe faster, who can tell?<br /> <br /> The Camarilla, for one, doesn't much care - they have enough fingers in enough pies, and enough interested parties amongst them, that nothing can ever <i>really</i> happen politically without their say-so. If they want to stop him, they can; if they want to enable him, they can - and if they simply don't care, well... they just let the snowball keep rolling, and what care have they for how many kine it flattens on the way down?<br /> <br /> The Garou Nation, their enemies? They're playing on a different playing field - they always have been. What does it matter if one human ascends to a hollow throne instead of the other? It won't stop the Wyrm. Better not to worry about it; sharpen the claws, batten down the hatches, and think about how best to kill all the bad guys before Judgment Day.<br /> <br /> But then, I think mortals and their political instruments matter a lot less in my games than in some others. The real power players are the supernaturals in the shadows, and they always have been. The winner of the election - and the next one, and the one after that - simply does not matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11105-seviphas","name":"Seviphas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-20T19:35:55-08:00","id":1432874,"title":"","content":"Now at the conclusion of his presidency looking back lets review things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-24T01:04:38-08:00","id":1433238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1004232#post1004232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This thread will be locked within eight replies, calling it now.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nine pages and five years later...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11490-dogstar","name":"Dogstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11490_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-24T02:30:35-08:00","id":1433242,"title":"","content":"You know, this really puts something I have been thinking about for some time now into perspective...<br /> <br /> ...the World of Darkness is supposed to be our world, just darker, and with the suprnatural. Everything is just a little more dangerous, callous, crime-ridden, broken down, etc.<br /> <br /> But how do you depict things like Donald Trump's presidency, companies like Foxconn (which drove several people to suicide with their employment practices), and banks like HSBC (which handled, and probably still handles, the money of drug cartels, terrorist organizations, and dictators) in the World of Darkness without it evolving into moustache-twirling levels of parady evil?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-24T14:38:59-08:00","id":1433306,"title":"","content":"I mean that\u2019s one of the oldest analyses people had of the World of Darkness, you just need to add supernaturals and play the darkest things as is. I do like to dramatize things by making shadows deeper and darker and what not but frankly you can rip most plot lines from the headlines of business and political news and things can be as bad as you could ask for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-25T08:51:32-08:00","id":1433401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1432874#post1432874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now at the conclusion of his presidency looking back lets review things.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ironically I would feel much safer in this world if the technocracy really existed and the attempted coup did not. Illuminati is more palatable than 'i just tried to murder Congress'<br /> <br /> Edit: The masses are too stupid and self serving to write their own destiny. Hooray for the New World Order!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-25T18:29:56-08:00","id":1433445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1433401#post1433401\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ironically I would feel much safer in this world if the technocracy really existed and the attempted coup did not. Illuminati is more palatable than 'i just tried to murder Congress'<br /> <br /> Edit: The masses are too stupid and self serving to write their own destiny. Hooray for the New World Order!</div> </div> </div> </div>The TU's tendency to heap everyone outside their club into one giant mess should really have bitten them on the ass a lot more in the setting. Kind of tangential and general, but after necromancy, where else does the thread go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T01:16:04-08:00","id":1433470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jackob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1433242#post1433242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, this really puts something I have been thinking about for some time now into perspective...<br /> <br /> ...the World of Darkness is supposed to be our world, just darker, and with the suprnatural. Everything is just a little more dangerous, callous, crime-ridden, broken down, etc.<br /> <br /> But how do you depict things like Donald Trump's presidency, companies like Foxconn (which drove several people to suicide with their employment practices), and banks like HSBC (which handled, and probably still handles, the money of drug cartels, terrorist organizations, and dictators) in the World of Darkness without it evolving into moustache-twirling levels of parady evil?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't care to get into the specifics (IE Trump), but when it comes to the supernatural influence on the natural, consider it from a view of balance and imbalance. When things are in balance there is harmony and little excess. When things are unbalanced... you can get excesses of one form or another. Stuff like inequalities, discrimination, etc. are just another set of symptoms of some larger/deeper cause just as there can be supernatural signs of that imbalance.<br /> <br /> As to how you address it, that depends on the game system. In Mage, for example reality is shaped greatly by the consensus. If the consensus is seen as a foundational part of 'righting' the imbalance then the plot might focus on discovering/uplifting certain signs, symbols/figures that could renew humanity's hope. It could be religious (Buddha, Christ and the birth of those respective religions), it could be political (Abraham Lincoln and the Reconstruction, FDR and the New Deal), or it could be cultural/religious (Civil Rights movement and Martin Luther King.) And just as you would have positive forces and symbols you could have 'anti-symbols' which are meant to create greater imbalance (I'll let people decide what those are for themselves lol) <br /> <br /> In a system like Demon it could be even something similar... just restoring faith and belief in something greater to humanity - their rediscovered potential. Or in Mummy, where balance and restoring the 'natural' order is a big part of things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25533-mister_dunpeal","name":"Mister_Dunpeal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T01:16:04-08:00","id":1433471,"title":"","content":"Oh and Werewolf is obviously big on 'balance' issues too, so there's all kinds of themes you can link to there <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25533-mister_dunpeal","name":"Mister_Dunpeal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:18:48-08:00","id":1433525,"title":"","content":"I would probably, generally, keep real world politics out of the WoD. I remember a thread a long while ago talking about the small things that make the WoD different from reality. Some things suggested included different stores, different brand names, etc. I would personally be inclined to include politics in this as well. I might even change the names of the main political parties in the US (Federalists and Whigs maybe?). Likewise, my politicians are generally going to be fictional. That's better in case the players decide to Dominate the mayor, or have to do something involving a fictional Senator's campaign. I do that to maintain maximum ST freedom to make the supporting characters anything I want them to be. And just to put it out there, I'm saying this as someone who is very much so not a Trump supporter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T14:42:11-08:00","id":1433546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChewyGranola</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1433525#post1433525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would probably, generally, keep real world politics out of the WoD. I remember a thread a long while ago talking about the small things that make the WoD different from reality. Some things suggested included different stores, different brand names, etc. I would personally be inclined to include politics in this as well. I might even change the names of the main political parties in the US (Federalists and Whigs maybe?). Likewise, my politicians are generally going to be fictional. That's better in case the players decide to Dominate the mayor, or have to do something involving a fictional Senator's campaign. I do that to maintain maximum ST freedom to make the supporting characters anything I want them to be. And just to put it out there, I'm saying this as someone who is very much so not a Trump supporter.</div> </div> </div> </div>If we kept real-world politics out of the WoD, the WoD wouldn't exist. Werewolf in particular is joined at the hip with environmental woes and international military conflicts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T14:51:29-08:00","id":1433547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1433546#post1433546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If we kept real-world politics out of the WoD, the WoD wouldn't exist. Werewolf in particular is joined at the hip with environmental woes and international military conflicts.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think he just means specific names.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-28T07:51:00-08:00","id":1433704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1433547#post1433547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think he just means specific names.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is exactly what I mean. I want my WoD politicians to be unbound by anyone in the real world so they can be what I want. Policies, persona, the works. That's what I mean by keeping real world politics out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-29T19:25:40-08:00","id":1433867,"title":"","content":"That cuts close to barring Pentex from being a thing, since it consists of barely-concealed, more or less obvious references to existing businesses, one of which is an obvious stand-in for FOX News.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-01T10:34:20-08:00","id":1434152,"title":"","content":"I'm not even remotely close to barring Pentex. Like I said, I tend to change names of PEOPLE. I will occasionally have new and invented businesses (like WW did with Pentex) so I can do the story things that I want to. But I typically draw the line at real world political figures and even celebrities sometimes, particularly if I need the PCs to interact with them somehow. Like I said, I don't keep real world political situations out of play, I just change names and whatever else I need to for the story. Like Law and Order does you know?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-02T00:25:32-08:00","id":1434231,"title":"","content":"One of the common themes of many of the game lines is how the supernatural controls politics. The Technocracy, Camarilla, and Pentax are all huge power players in mundane politics. Of course, they also say that some things are just caused by humans too, so it\u2019s a mix.<br /> <br /> If I were to include Trump in a WoD game, I think I would it his portrayal reflect reality in a major sense: Trump is a normal guy and not really under anybody\u2019s control. He is a weird candidate that isn\u2019t a pawn of the Camarilla, Pentex, or the Technocracy but they never took him seriously until he won. Kind of like what happened with the real DC establishment. I\u2019d probably say that in the WoD 2020 election that Trump actually did get a substantial majority of the votes but then cheating made it look like he lost. <br /> <br /> Of course, even in a fictional world, any way you portray Trump or contemporary politics in general is going to be contentious, so it depends on the players. I probably wouldn\u2019t include Trump in a game with my current circle of gaming friends because at this point we\u2019d all probably rather have a bit of escapism in our RPGs rather than remind us of real issues stressing us out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1129,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","user":"Sergeant Brother","date":". 02-04-2021, 06:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-02T01:13:27-08:00","id":1434233,"title":"","content":"Donald Trump has, incidentally, already been written into a Kult: Divinity Lost scenario: And the Rocket\u2019s Red Glare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-02T18:45:52-08:00","id":1434327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1004230-donald-trump-in-the-wod?p=1434231#post1434231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the common themes of many of the game lines is how the supernatural controls politics. The Technocracy, Camarilla, and Pentax are all huge power players in mundane politics. Of course, they also say that some things are just caused by humans too, so it\u2019s a mix.<br /> <br /> If I were to include Trump in a WoD game, I think I would it his portrayal reflect reality in a major sense: Trump is a normal guy and not really under anybody\u2019s control. He is a weird candidate that isn\u2019t a pawn of the Camarilla, Pentex, or the Technocracy but they never took him seriously until he won. Kind of like what happened with the real DC establishment. I\u2019d probably say that in the WoW 2020 election that Trump actually did get a substantial majority of the votes but then cheating made it look like he lost.</div> </div> </div> </div>The World of Warcraft is welcome to him, but I'd prefer to not try to feed conspiracy theories like that, particularly when it comes to former presidents not living in reality.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Of course, even in a fictional world, any way you portray Trump or contemporary politics in general is going to be contentious, so it depends on the players. I probably wouldn\u2019t include Trump in a game with my current circle of gaming friends because at this point we\u2019d all probably rather have a bit of escapism in our RPGs rather than remind us of real issues stressing us out. </div> </div> </div>It's not really doable to escape like that in Werewolf. Even if you polish off the serial numbers, the existential environmental and social issues are still there, looming on the horizon and spitting out banes in addition to their real world effects. Meanwhile, a good-sized cross-section of characters are born to endangered species, sometimes incredibly endangered species, and would realistically be likely to be suffering PTSD before gribbly monsters even show their heads on account of how their lives are very far from any notion of safe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 02-02-2021, 09:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-03T09:54:34-08:00","id":1434393,"title":"","content":"My ongoing Werewolf game started in 2015 and we started the in-game date in October of that month. Due to a day-to-day play style and lots of time between sessions we are now up to May 2016. The election is proceeding as it did in reality, and I have Trump as a Silver Fang kinfolk. The characters do not know this. They recently discovered that there is a network of corrupted SF kin coordinating nastiness. They might have made the connection but the Silver Fangs at their Sept took it upon themselves to purge this corruption fro their tribe. They went off on a quest to hunt down every corrupted kin they could identify and, barring character intervention, this is going to end poorly.<br /> <br /> Still, it is designed to be background material showing the devolving state of the world as it spirals towards the apocalypse. I know it it may not be everyone's cup of tea but it works well for our group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/693-thomasm","name":"ThomasM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar693_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-16T00:58:08-08:00","id":1435625,"title":"","content":"Donald is obviously a Marauder from MtA :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Ever since the Followers of Set rebranded themselves as The Ministry, I can barely keep a straight face around them.&quot; - Ramona","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15944-ravnos","name":"Ravnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15944_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-18T20:29:15-08:00","id":1435944,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Canonically, Donald is clearly a mundane human because the President is always one according to Project: Twilight. I say this as someone who had Fred Trump as a 12th generation Ventrue.<br /> <br /> Closed for necromancy.</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}